  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Beyond Homophobia Conference 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The goal of Beyond Homophobia is both to bring together organizations and individuals who are working&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;towards visibility and equality of all people, specifically members of the LGBTQ+ community throughout&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;the Caribbean and its diaspora as well as showcase and support academic, activist and artistic work already&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;being undertaken throughout public and private sectors&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
